# machine translated (Hindi), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Reason shown when a picture of a kind that cannot be turned is turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn = Folders सिर्फ़ JPEG, PNG, WebP और BMP तस्वीरें घुमा सकता है

# Reason shown when a picture file could not be read for turning or resizing.
folders-imaging-unreadable = Folders तस्वीर पढ़ नहीं सका

# Reason shown when a resized picture would have to be written in a kind Folders cannot write.
folders-imaging-no-write = Folders इस तरह की तस्वीर सहेज नहीं सकता

# Why a link to a picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-link = यह एक लिंक है, इसलिए इसके बजाय वह तस्वीर घुमाएँ जिसकी ओर यह जाता है

# Why a moving picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-moving = Folders एनिमेटेड तस्वीरें नहीं घुमाता, क्योंकि केवल पहला फ़्रेम रह जाएगा
